{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And if its appearance.</b> It is not grammatically possible to have מראה with kamatz gadol under the alef and the he with mappiq, like ידה רגלה, for this is not found with words possessing a quiescent he at the end of the word, along with the dagesh of nun."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:49.596019529Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}